  "limitations": [
    "Academy changes are on the owner-approved branch v2/desktop-presentation (commits 65bf3e81..5d5d7616, pinned with tree hash in docs/architecture/inputs.lock.json); Academy web regressions: docs/planning/evidence/C05/academy-regression.log plus the xtask shared gates (Academy typecheck, presentation tests, vite build).",
    "D029 (decisions.md): the desktop declares host capabilities to Academy's LearnerHost: labs are previewed (lab runs are outside the desktop account allowlist; C06 owns guided lab submission), lesson diagrams use the pipeline's pre-rendered SVG artifacts (mermaid cannot load under Tauri freezePrototype; CSP and freezePrototype are kept), external lesson links are not opened.",
